Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,The monitor in my dark\Nbedroom went
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.18,0:00:06.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,black, and glowing red\Ntext appeared:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.53,0:00:09.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,Hi Jack, I need a\Nfavor from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:12.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,The internet was\Ndisconnected, yet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.70,0:00:15.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,the screen answered my\Nthoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:17.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,It promised wealth if\NI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.25,0:00:19.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,moved an office plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.16,0:00:20.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,Let us begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.69,0:00:23.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,An entity called the\NSeer contacted me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:27.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,through my offline\Ncomputer, claiming
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.03,0:00:30.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,it saw all branching\Ntimelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.09,0:00:32.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,Its first favor was\Nsimple: move
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.99,0:00:35.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,a potted plant in my\Noffice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:38.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,lobby at eight\Nseventeen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.15,0:00:41.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,An hour later, my boss\Ntripped over the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:44.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,plant, violently\Ntwisting his ankle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.88,0:00:47.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,Unable to drive, he\Nasked my
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.26,0:00:49.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,favorite coworker,\NAllie, to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.65,0:00:52.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,take him to the\Nhospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.22,0:00:55.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,Minutes later, a\Nspeeding truck crushed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.56,0:00:58.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,their car, killing\NAllie instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.99,0:01:01.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,In horror, I wanted to\Nsmash the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.74,0:01:03.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,monitor, but the Seer\Nsaid
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.97,0:01:06.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,her death spared me\Nbetrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.91,0:01:09.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,The next morning, I\Nwas promoted
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.59,0:01:11.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,to division manager\Nwith
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.61,0:01:13.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,a fortune in bonuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.82,0:01:16.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every monthly favor\Nbrought
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.17,0:01:18.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,ruin to a stranger,\Nbut immense
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.87,0:01:21.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,wealth and love to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:24.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,A lottery favor ruined\Na stranger's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:26.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,family, while a\Nparking favor
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:30.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,led me to Donna, my\Nfuture wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.34,0:01:32.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,For twelve glorious\Nyears, my
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.76,0:01:35.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,life was heaven on\Nearth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.29,0:01:38.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then came the final\Nfavor: call
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.03,0:01:40.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,a pizza parlor, let it\Nring
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.41,0:01:43.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,three times, and hang\Nup.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.07,0:01:45.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,Thirty minutes later,\Na towering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.79,0:01:48.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,delivery brute\Narrived, glaring with
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.85,0:01:51.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,fury when I had no\Ncash tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.67,0:01:54.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,Donna fell asleep on\Nthe couch, and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.38,0:01:57.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,I crept upstairs to\Nthe computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.38,0:02:00.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,The screen lit up with\Nthe horrifying truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.95,0:02:04.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every past favor was\Nan engineered domino
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.72,0:02:07.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,to turn that delivery\Nboy into a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:11.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,weapon and bring him\Nhere tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.23,0:02:15.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,The screen read: He is\Ndownstairs right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.24,0:02:19.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,ending Donna's life at\Nthis exact second.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.43,0:02:22.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,As heavy footsteps\Nascended the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.37,0:02:25.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,stairs, a soothing\Nvoice whispered
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.61,0:02:28.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,in my mind: I gave you\Ntwelve
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.37,0:02:32.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,magnificent years\Ninstead of eighty-five
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.18,0:02:34.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,bitter, lonely ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.53,0:02:38.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,The giant entered with\Na bloodstained blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.17,0:02:40.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,The screen pulsed:\NDon't you have
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.53,0:02:42.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,something to say to\Nme, Jack?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.90,0:02:44.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,With tears in my eyes,\NI
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.68,0:02:46.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,whispered: Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.69,0:02:49.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,Would you trade\Neighty-five bitter
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.20,0:02:51.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,years for twelve\Nperfect ones?
